{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "a090a9914544975c",
			"type": "group",
			"x": -24,
			"y": 253,
			"width": 2080,
			"height": 199,
			"label": "1 · GET THESE FIRST",
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "8107d2655f1c9a29",
			"type": "group",
			"x": -24,
			"y": 522,
			"width": 2080,
			"height": 522,
			"label": "2 · SET IT UP, IN ORDER",
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "114dc07eb2366a34",
			"type": "group",
			"x": -24,
			"y": 1114,
			"width": 2080,
			"height": 344,
			"label": "3 · EVERY DAY, ONCE IT'S RUNNING",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "e9aa8976cd3e024b",
			"type": "group",
			"x": -24,
			"y": 1528,
			"width": 1050,
			"height": 330,
			"label": "4 · THE RULES IT FOLLOWS",
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "cfbbe9a23b790400",
			"type": "group",
			"x": 1050,
			"y": 1528,
			"width": 1006,
			"height": 330,
			"label": "5 · WHEN SOMETHING LOOKS WRONG",
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "ba08e8ac99f240c4",
			"type": "group",
			"x": -24,
			"y": 1928,
			"width": 2080,
			"height": 336,
			"label": "YOUR NOTES · fill these in as you go",
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "bfc2c24cda56fd5e",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 1060,
			"height": 183,
			"text": "# X Autopilot · Setup Map\nPost about **your niche**, from **sources you pick**, in **your voice**. Your AI agent sets it up by asking you questions.\n\n🟧 Get these  ·  🟦 Set up in order  ·  🟩 Every day  ·  🟪 Rules  ·  🟥 Fixes  ·  🟨 Your notes"
		},
		{
			"id": "789d649006d36d84",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1084,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 500,
			"height": 183,
			"text": "## ![github|26](https://cdn.simpleicons.org/github/181717/ffffff) Get the code\n**[github.com/coulditbecoley/x-autopilot](https://github.com/coulditbecoley/x-autopilot)**\n\nFree, MIT. **Code → Download ZIP**, then unzip.",
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "aaf3aec0c369b478",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1608,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 183,
			"text": "## 💵 What it costs\n- **Code:** free\n- **Writing posts:** Claude Code login or an API key\n- **Reading X:** Apify, pay per result\n- **Posting live:** depends on your tool",
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "33d25eb0ff0863f7",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 293,
			"width": 392,
			"height": 135,
			"text": "## ![claude|22](https://api.iconify.design/logos/claude-icon.svg) 1 · AI agent\n**Claude Code** or ![openai|18](https://api.iconify.design/simple-icons/openai.svg?color=%2310a37f) **Codex**, installed and signed in. It does the setup for you.",
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "4810a2072e7e15ea",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 416,
			"y": 293,
			"width": 392,
			"height": 135,
			"text": "## ![python|22](https://api.iconify.design/logos/python.svg) 2 · Python\n**python.org/downloads**, 3.9 or newer. Your agent checks this first.",
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "99805415ed4c6c41",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 832,
			"y": 293,
			"width": 392,
			"height": 135,
			"text": "## ![apify|22](https://api.iconify.design/logos/apify-icon.svg) 3 · Apify\nHow it reads X. **apify.com** → **Settings → API & Integrations** → create a token.",
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "7402a1bc189f0c52",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1248,
			"y": 293,
			"width": 392,
			"height": 135,
			"text": "## ✍️ 4 · A writer\nYour **Claude Code login** (no key), or an ![anthropic|18](https://cdn.simpleicons.org/anthropic/191919/ffffff) Anthropic / ![openai|18](https://api.iconify.design/simple-icons/openai.svg?color=%2310a37f) OpenAI key.",
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "fbc6666e01bbec01",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1664,
			"y": 293,
			"width": 392,
			"height": 135,
			"text": "## ⏳ Later, not now\nTo go live, pick one: ![x|18](https://cdn.simpleicons.org/x/000000/ffffff) **X API**, ![zernio|18](https://zernio.com/favicon.ico) **Zernio**, or a webhook (![zapier|18](https://api.iconify.design/logos/zapier-icon.svg) ![make|18](https://cdn.simpleicons.org/make) ![n8n|18](https://api.iconify.design/logos/n8n.svg))."
		},
		{
			"id": "e4b737f5bea8ff0c",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 562,
			"width": 488,
			"height": 131,
			"text": "### 1 · Open the folder\nOpen the unzipped folder in your agent. You should see **SETUP.md**.",
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "afdfe1c9accd307e",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 512,
			"y": 562,
			"width": 488,
			"height": 131,
			"text": "### 2 · Say one sentence\n> Read SETUP.md and set this up for me.",
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "29bec9a013450464",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1024,
			"y": 562,
			"width": 488,
			"height": 131,
			"text": "### 3 · Answer its questions\nOne at a time, each with a default. The big three are below.",
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "d02447bcdf897e18",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1536,
			"y": 562,
			"width": 488,
			"height": 131,
			"text": "### 4 · Add your keys\nPaste them into **.env** yourself, never the chat. Windows: not **.env.txt**.",
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "fab2249d2b556c29",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 727,
			"width": 488,
			"height": 131,
			"text": "### 5 · Let it test\nIt runs a self test, a setup check, then **dry runs** that show posts without sending.",
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "56f467fce09db390",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 512,
			"y": 727,
			"width": 488,
			"height": 131,
			"text": "### 6 · Tune the voice\nNot you? Tell the agent what to change and rerun until you'd post it.",
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "69980b33a1d8e4c7",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1024,
			"y": 727,
			"width": 488,
			"height": 131,
			"text": "### 7 · Schedule it\nRuns on its own on ![windows|16](https://api.iconify.design/logos/microsoft-windows-icon.svg) ![apple|16](https://cdn.simpleicons.org/apple/000000/ffffff) ![linux|16](https://api.iconify.design/logos/linux-tux.svg). The computer must be **on and online**.",
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "70b9d2426b9c840e",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1536,
			"y": 727,
			"width": 488,
			"height": 131,
			"text": "### 8 · Go live\nAfter a week of drafts: connect your posting tool, approve **one test post**, check it on ![x|16](https://cdn.simpleicons.org/x/000000/ffffff).",
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "4f7242866d54fc62",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 892,
			"width": 665,
			"height": 128,
			"text": "#### 🎯 Your topic\nGaming, fitness, real estate, AI. Each gets hashtags its people follow. Posts end with **1 or 2**."
		},
		{
			"id": "519d04af63bb6665",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 689,
			"y": 892,
			"width": 665,
			"height": 128,
			"text": "#### 📡 Your sources\n**8 to 15 X accounts** per topic. Big news accounts beat personal ones."
		},
		{
			"id": "ce7ed43cda9862f2",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1378,
			"y": 892,
			"width": 665,
			"height": 128,
			"text": "#### 🗣️ Your voice\nPaste **5 to 10 of your posts** and the agent writes your voice for you."
		},
		{
			"id": "8f8ffd347bf39590",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 1154,
			"width": 316,
			"height": 128,
			"text": "#### ![x|18](https://cdn.simpleicons.org/x/000000/ffffff) Your sources\nThe accounts you picked post as usual.",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "207f54bffe678da7",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 340,
			"y": 1154,
			"width": 316,
			"height": 128,
			"text": "#### 🔄 Scan\nEvery 2 hours in your posting window.",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "1c05f9e201ae587a",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 680,
			"y": 1154,
			"width": 316,
			"height": 128,
			"text": "#### 🧹 Filter\nCode keeps original posts picking up fast. No AI yet.",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "b394679764668827",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1020,
			"y": 1154,
			"width": 316,
			"height": 128,
			"text": "#### 🧠 AI decides\nReal news? It writes **one** post in your voice.",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "96a33af9ba9ed1c7",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1360,
			"y": 1154,
			"width": 316,
			"height": 128,
			"text": "#### ✅ Checks\nShort, no links, 1 or 2 hashtags, a question, numbers from the source.",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "2d3529c7b11f261e",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1700,
			"y": 1154,
			"width": 316,
			"height": 128,
			"text": "#### 📤 Post or nothing\nPasses: posts or saves a draft. No story: **nothing**. Normal.",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "4f6c94ee045e483f",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 1306,
			"width": 665,
			"height": 128,
			"text": "#### ☀️ Every morning: reply list\nUp to **25 big posts** with a reply drafted and a button that opens X filled in. **You send them.**",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "883f8a99366cf81f",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 689,
			"y": 1306,
			"width": 665,
			"height": 128,
			"text": "#### 📝 Optional: daily post\nWrites about **what you did**, from your notes or git commits, checked for private names first.",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "fa55ff9b3f45a531",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1378,
			"y": 1306,
			"width": 665,
			"height": 128,
			"text": "#### ⏱️ Your 5 minutes a day\nSend a few replies, answer people who reply to you, glance at the log. This is what grows an account.",
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "ba91d3277b171f53",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 1568,
			"width": 489,
			"height": 104,
			"text": "#### 📄 Drafts first\nNothing posts until **you** switch to live.",
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "872d1eb541029fd9",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 513,
			"y": 1568,
			"width": 489,
			"height": 104,
			"text": "#### 💬 Replies stay manual\nX requires written approval for AI reply bots.",
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "e284557564670acd",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 1696,
			"width": 489,
			"height": 138,
			"text": "#### 🔒 Privacy check\nBlocks names you list, links and paths. Fails? Skips the day.",
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "c37ed8cf49428e22",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 513,
			"y": 1696,
			"width": 489,
			"height": 138,
			"text": "#### 🤫 Silence over filler\nNo real story, no post. It never fills a slot.",
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "943df13c7f5ca9f6",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1074,
			"y": 1568,
			"width": 958,
			"height": 266,
			"text": "Every run logs a line in **state/run.log**. Read it first, or ask your agent.\n\n| You see | Means | Do |\n|---|---|---|\n| **QUIET** | No story worth posting | Nothing, it's normal |\n| **SKIP no candidates** | Sources too quiet | Add bigger accounts |\n| **FAIL** 401 / 403 | Key wrong or expired | New key in .env |\n| No new lines | Schedule not running | Ask the agent to check it |\n\nA gap in your feed can be a **dead key**, not a quiet week. To stop it, ask your agent to turn off the jobs.",
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "06c973973c06c848",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 1968,
			"width": 488,
			"height": 272,
			"text": "#### 🧰 My setup\n- [ ] Agent: Claude Code / Codex\n- [ ] Python checked\n- [ ] Apify token in .env\n- [ ] Writer: \n- [ ] Posting tool (later): ",
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "3d693f4f46a5f412",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 512,
			"y": 1968,
			"width": 488,
			"height": 272,
			"text": "#### 🎯 My niche\nTopics:\n\nHashtags:\n\nMax posts a day:\n\nPosting hours:",
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "b8d7feab367c6f2e",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1024,
			"y": 1968,
			"width": 488,
			"height": 272,
			"text": "#### 📡 My sources\n1.\n2.\n3.\n4.\n5.\n6.\n7.\n8.",
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "ff23a69cec513f3a",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1536,
			"y": 1968,
			"width": 488,
			"height": 272,
			"text": "#### 🗣️ My voice\nIn a few words:\n\nNever post about:\n\nNames to keep private:",
			"color": "3"
		}
	],
